<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR SEES '97 NET UP TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR SEES '97 NET UP TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish leather company Chemiskor SA sees its 1997 net profit rising to 1.3 million zlotys, up from last year's 660,000 zlotys, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Chemiskor did not give any other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
